    THEN -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A cause of action must not be divided for the purpose of bringing 2 or more actions" (the text names no bearer of the prohibition, so no SHANT rule is derived: N2)
         JUST FALSE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar is on dividing "for the purpose of bringing 2 or more actions"; a division for another purpose is not mentioned
    ELSE NOTHING

